From 0b06735cfc67f91cdf01a7fa6777df1afefb3782 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: del mundo <yelshame5@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:29:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Weekly pay, account page, leave requests, lens supply orders

- Overview: hide branches and team sections from sellers; branch accounts
  (treasuries and payment methods) now open behind a button.
- Salary and worked hours are weekly (Saturday to Friday): payroll sheets must
  cover one week, shift panel and daily overview show weekly hours.
- New account page opened from the user name in the top bar: weekly salary,
  commission, paid advances, remaining salary, payroll history, password
  change (verifies the current password) and leave/permission requests.
- Owner reviews leave and permission requests in the staff and payroll tab.
- Top bar and login use the same artwork as the app icon.
- Lens supply: pick the lens company, see lenses ordered on customer invoices,
  mark which arrived and complete the supplier invoice. Requires migration
  20261017030000_leave_requests_lens_orders.sql.

